//T_Messenger.npc

*J_NAME		"Messenger Ian"

*J_CHAT		"How are you? I'm Ian, the messenger of Temskron." 
*J_CHAT		"I deliver urgent messages all over the continent."
*J_CHAT		"Currently, all the kingdoms in Priston are under suppressing monsters."
*J_CHAT		"There are many powerful monsters out of the village, so be careful."